  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往哥拉尔镇的海豚酒吧（136.158），游侠职业与信使巴德对话，获得【娜蕾希亚的邀请函】。",
      "type": "career-item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◆仅游侠职业可获得【娜蕾希亚的邀请函】",
      "type": "career-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "2.前往库鲁克斯岛（440.361），携带【娜蕾希亚的邀请函】的队员与赛诺对话，可带领全队进入头目的隐藏山路。",
      "type": "party-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "◆队伍中只需一人携带【娜蕾希亚的邀请函】",
      "type": "party-item-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "◆头目的隐藏山路为固定地图；魔物为Lv.58风蜘蛛，全域可随机遭遇Lv.1风蜘蛛",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "3.通过黄色传送石，抵达头目的隐藏山路，通过随机迷宫抵达头目的房间 。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "◆头目的隐藏山路为随机迷宫，约5层；魔物为Lv.75~77风蜘蛛、猫妖、大蝙蝠、杀人螳螂",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "4.①游侠职业与娜蕾希亚（13.8）对话，获得【被支配的记忆】并传送至头目的房间前，继续任务第5步。",
      "type": "career-branch",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "◆【被支配的记忆】：双击【被支配的记忆】仍可传送至头目的房间前，可以重复使用；不可交易",
      "type": "item-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "②非游侠职业与娜蕾希亚（13.8）对话，获得【头目帽子的制法】并被传出房间至库鲁克斯岛且任务完结。",
      "type": "career-branch",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "◆【头目帽子的制法】：资深帽子师傅双击可习得【头目帽子】的制作方法；无法交易、丢地消失",
      "type": "recipe-item-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "◆【头目帽子】",
      "type": "recipe-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "⑴所需材料：【可爱的扁帽子】*1、【钢骑之矿】*3、【魔族水晶】*3、【香草】*20",
      "type": "recipe-materials",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "⑵属性：LV.8帽子、耐久200；防御+56、命中+5、闪躲+3；巧取耗魔减少50%；装备后获得称号“卡拉班一家”",
      "type": "crafted-item-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "5.在头目的房间前，游侠职业分别与红叶的怨念（19.30）、裁判员（22.9）对话进入战斗，通过取巧获得【朽红叶】、【审振】。（无顺序要求）",
      "type": "branch-overview",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "⑴与红叶的怨念对话进入战斗，通过取巧红叶的怨念获得【朽红叶】。",
      "type": "skill-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "◆战斗信息：",
      "type": "battle-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "Lv.39红叶的怨念*2，1动，血量约1000~1400；不死系；属性：水50火50；抗咒；技能：攻击、自爆、超强火焰魔法",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "◆【朽红叶】：Lv.4戒指、耐久5；攻击+300、防御-200、敏捷-100、命中-50、闪躲-50、生命-500；可以交易",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "⑵与裁判员对话进入战斗，通过巧取裁判员获得【审振】。",
      "type": "skill-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "◆战斗信息：",
      "type": "battle-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "Lv.100裁判员，血量约166000~186000；邪魔系；属性：全100；抗咒；技能：大地之怒、逃跑",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "◆【审振】：Lv.10不明、耐久1000；每次双击使用后耐久减少1点并伴随有音效",
      "type": "item-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "7.游侠职业同时携带【朽红叶】、【审振】，重复步骤1-3到达头目的房间，与娜蕾希亚（13.8）对话，获得称号“游侠王”，任务完结。",
      "type": "completion-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "◆游侠职业获得称号“游侠王”后不可重解任务，亦不可再次带人学习【头目帽子的制法】以及其他职业重解该任务。",
      "type": "completion-lock",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "但若保留【被支配的记忆】，则双击【被支配的记忆】仍可传送至头目的房间前，亦可与NPC对话进入战斗。",
      "type": "post-completion-item-use",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    }
  ],
